1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,280
 Just as the man in my passport story needed an authorized stamp

2
00:00:05,280 --> 00:00:08,200
 in his passport to enter a foreign country,

3
00:00:08,880 --> 00:00:13,420
 so each of us needs the verifying witness of the Holy Spirit of promise

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:17,080
 in order for us to receive the eternal blessings

5
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:22,240
 associated with the covenants and ordinances of the Savior's gospel.

6
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:28,360
 Each of us should ever be grateful for sacred offerings

